Minterms are numbered with x1 as the least significant bit. The 3-input function f has ones at minterms {0, 1, 2, 5, 6, 7}. Which of these functions, given by their ones, is NPN-equivalent to f?

A) {2, 5}

B) {2, 6}

C) {5, 6}

D) {2, 4}

